kindling-spark-os
  https://github.com/kindlingai/kindling-spark-os, AGPL-3.0 (vendor/kindling-spark-os/LICENSE)

  vendor/kindling-spark-os/ is kindling-spark-os at the release that
  vendor/kindling-spark-os.json records, with patches/kindling-spark-os/ applied.
  In it, dispram/dispramd.py and dispram/rmlist.c are AGPL-3.0-or-later.
  dispram/python/ and dispram/vllm/ are GPL-3.0-or-later with the exception in
  dispram/BUNDLING-EXCEPTION (dispram/LICENSE-GPL).

  nix/modules/kindling/, nix/packages.nix, nix/pkgs/dispram.nix, nix/pkgs/mentat-Cargo.lock
  and nix/tests/vm.nix began as the NixOS port of kindling-spark-os's host services, on the
  nixos-port branch of https://github.com/OnixResearch/kindling-spark-os. This repository
  keeps that history. nix/pkgs/mentat-Cargo.lock is mentat's (MIT OR Apache-2.0).

nixos-dgx-spark
  https://github.com/graham33/nixos-dgx-spark at c646a19a5df3316c1b0e79e2025d59f8deb704de,
  MIT (LICENSES/MIT-nixos-dgx-spark.txt)

