straylight-software/nixos-dgx-spark
  https://github.com/straylight-software/nixos-dgx-spark, MIT. A fork of graham33's. No files
  come from it. The services module and its VM test support its nixpkgs.

Not in this repository
  A built system fetches NVIDIA's driver and its dgx-spark-mlnx-hotplug package. Both are
  unfree, so never publish a built system or push one to a public cache.
